<title>FINLAND: OP-OSAKE HAS SOLD ILKKA STAKE.</title>
<headline>OP-OSAKE HAS SOLD ILKKA STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Op-Osake Oy -- part of cooperative controlled bank OKOBANK -- has sold its 12.29 percent stake of Ilkka Oy's series II shares on November 21, Ilkka said in a statement.</p>
<p>OKOBANK's brokerage Opstock on that day made a 139,700 share in-house transaction but declined to comment the day.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
